<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44377" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔληπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easily taken hold of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽ εὔληπτον εἶναι τὸ ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					1.16.2
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				11.5
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			). Adv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἔκπωμα
				εὐληπτότατα ἐνδιδόναι</span> to give it <i>so that one
				can most easily take hold of it</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.3.8
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔ. τὰ τῆς διατριβῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>VP</u>
					7.33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>easy to be taken</i> or <i>reduced</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νησιῶται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.85
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἧττον εὔ. πόλις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					3.43
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔ. ὀργῇ, κόλαξι</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.590
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.66b
			</span></i>; <i>easy to gain or obtain</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
				10
			</span></i>; <i>easy to apprehend</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἀκούουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Protr.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
